("N","N ... N ... Neptune! Eighth major planet from the Sun | outer-planet scale before the Kuiper Belt."),
("O","O? Observatory! Facility built for astronomical observing | returns our zoom to human-made instruments."),
("P","P is Probe. Robotic spacecraft sent to collect data | tool that can travel far without becoming the thing it studies."),
