("R","R ... R ... Rover! Mobile surface vehicle explores ground on another world | hardware at local surface scale."),
("S","S? Satellite! Object in orbit around another body | can be natural like a moon or artificial like a spacecraft."),
("T","T is Telescope. Collects radiation from distant sources | bridge between human scale and cosmic scale."),
("U","U — Universe! All space-time, matter, energy and cosmic contents we can describe | widest scale in the song."),
